an pink fibrotic tissue with focal areas of fat necrosis with no discrete masses or lesions grossly appreciated  Representative sections of the exposed cavity are submitted in cassettes A D and the uninvolved superior margin in cassette E and the uninvolved inferior margin in cassette F  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved lateral REMOVED_DATE of cavity  are 2 irregular  unoriented tan yellow to pink lobulated portions of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  Both portions are serially sectioned to reveal an unremarkable fibrofatty cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes G H  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin medial REMOVED_DATE of cavity  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm irregular  unoriented tan pink to yellow fibrofatty portion of soft tissue with cauterizing artifact along one aspect  The unoriented specimen is serially sectioned to reveal an unremarkable cut surface  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes I L  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  CHRISTOPHER M  WILLIAM  MD   Ph D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST LEFT  LATERAL REMOVED_DATE SHAVED MARGIN  EXCISION PART C  BREAST LEFT  MEDIAL REMOVED_DATE SHAVED MARGIN  EXCISION , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
