ctioned from lateral to medial to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm white slightly firm area with surrounding possible fat necrosis and fibrosis  This area measures 0 9cm from closest  posterior  margin and 0 8cm from the superior posterior margin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  SECTION CODE  T  White area with closest margin  posterior  U W  White area to deep margin X  Deep margin Y  Superior margin Z  Inferior lateral margin AA  Lateral most margin BB  Unremarkable parenchyma anterior margin CC  Biopsy site to anterior margin DD  Unremarkable parenchyma to deep medial margin GG II  Other sections of firm area  Labeled  shaved inferior and anterior margin  are six fragments of breast aggregating 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  submitted entirely in cassette EE FF  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Janey Sue Pratt  M D  PART A  BREAST  SHAVED MEDIAL MARGIN  PART B  BREAST  SHAVED LATERAL MARGIN  PART C  BREAST  SHAVED SUPERIOR AND DEEP MARGINS  PART D  BREAST  ADDITIONAL INFERIOR MARGIN  PART E  BREAST  RIGHT   6 O CLOCK   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART F  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION PART G  BREAST  SHAVED INFERIOR AND ANTERIOR MARGINS    report_end  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
