s of tan yellow to pink lobulated unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  Along the periphery no lymph nodes are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A  Cavity to posterior margin  B  Cavity to anterior margin in area of suture defect  C D  Representative sections of cavity wall with cavity to subjacent rubbery  fibrotic tissue and deep margin in cassette D  E F  Ill defined fibrotic rubbery area  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  LYNN CORNELL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael J Yaremchuk  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Mastectomy.
