erior inked black  Sectioning reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm biopsy cavity which is cystic and with reddish discoloration  Posteriorly the cavity is rimmed by ill defined firm tissue which is 0 7cm thick and overall REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  The posterior fat is freely movable over this firmness which is 0 2cm to the posterior margin  The cavity itself is 1 5cm from the posterior margin  and anteriorly the skin covers the area of underlying biopsy cavity  Laterally the firm tissue extends beyond the anterior area surfaced by skin and comes to 0 4cm to the anterior margin  The biopsy cavity and firmness is greater than 1cm from the lateral  inferior  superior  and medial margins  In the same plane of the biopsy cavity  but 2 1cm superior to it  is a separate ill defined solid REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm mass which is close  0 4cm   but grossly not involving the posterior margin  This mass is greater than 1cm to the superior  inferior  anterior  lateral  and medial margins  The remaining breast parenchyma is unremarkable  No lymph nodes are present  The following cassettes are submitted   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral extension of firm tissue near biopsy cavity with anterior and posterior margins included   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of biopsy cavity with posterior margin included   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Solid mass away from the biopsy cavity submitted in toto  Included in the sections is the posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue away from biopsy cavity  Gross Dictation by Christopher K Hysell M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Christopher K Hysell M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Christopher K Hysell M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Christine Garcia M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR HER 2 c erbB 2 Breast  Right  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    The tumor cells do not show overexpression of HER 2 c erbB 2  See note  Note  These tests were developed and their performance characteristics determined by the Pathology Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Addendum by Atul K Bhan M D   on REMOVED_DATE Addendum  1 by Atul K Bhan M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Mastectomy.
