n   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and   left breast re excision   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 7cm yellow white irregular fibrofatty tissue with a short stitch designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior blue  posterior black  medial green  and lateral yellow  There are three irregular defects ranging from REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm to REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  on the superior  lateral  and posterior aspects  These defects communicate to a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm cavity with a red hemorrhagic shaggy lining  The cavity comes to within 1 0cm of the inferior margin  0 7cm from the anterior margin  and 1 3cm from the medial margin  The specimen is serially sectioned from superior to inferior to reveal a yellow to chalky tan glistening to tan and fibrous areas surrounding the cavity  No definitive tumor is identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section to superior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of the cavity sequentially from superior to inferior   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial sections to inferior margin  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast medial posterior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm irregular yellow white fibrofatty tissue with a stitch designating the new margin  inked black   The cut surface consists of yellow lobulated adipose tissue and white rubbery fibrous tissue  No definitive masses are identified  Representative sections are submitted in blocks  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The remainder of the specimen is submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and   left breast superior margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 2cm yellow white fibrofatty tissue with a stitch designating the new margin  inked b