e closest inked medial inferior resection margin  Further sectioning demonstrates numerous pale tan  fibrous bands which extend out into the adipose tissue  There are focal areas of nodular firmness scattered throughout the breast  Section code  AandB Closest deep biopsy cavity resection margins C  Closest medial resection margin of biopsy cavity D G Representative sections of biopsy cavity H  Representative lateral breast parenchyma I  Representative medial breast parenchyma J K Representative section of fibrous areas L  Representative areola M  Representative scar Resident  Timothy R  Quinn  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael J Yaremchuk  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Mastectomy.
