enchyma in the inferior portion of the specimen  Other areas show small cysts  Lymph nodes ranging in size from 0 3cm to 1 4cm are dissected from the axillary tail  All lymph nodes show a fleshy pink  unremarkable parenchyma  SECTION CODE A  Anterior margin  B  Lateral margin  C  Posterior margin  D  Representative lesion  E F  Representative unremarkable adjacent breast  G M  Axillary lymph nodes  from medial to lateral  Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Frederick William Ackroyd  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
